  "dailyPoolNote": "Built from the gta.wiki 'List of Daily Challenges', reworded slightly and with duplicates merged (Deathmatch, Survival and the race types are listed twice on the wiki). Items the wiki marks 'Removed' are left out: Challenge a player at Darts/Golf, Arm Wrestling, Flight School Gold Medal, Vanilla Unicorn private dance, Stunt Jump, One on One Deathmatch and Impromptu Race. The wiki warns that some older PvP objectives may also have been removed since the 2019 Casino update. Its '(*) confirmed available' markers are incomplete, so availability of the older Game Mode items is not guaranteed. 'Pull a parachute 30 meters from the ground' is folded into 'Deploy your parachute near the ground'. 'E&E only' means PS5, Xbox Series X|S and PC Enhanced.",
